{"4431400": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Smersh: Wolfhound", "steam_appid": 4431400, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SOCIAL STEALTH</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4431400/extras/1c07458f327de0d9ce36992db3fbb4e7.poster.avif?t=1780158940\" width=1170 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4431400/extras/1c07458f327de0d9ce36992db3fbb4e7.webm?t=1780158940\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4431400/extras/1c07458f327de0d9ce36992db3fbb4e7.mp4?t=1780158940\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch disguises: you can disguise yourself in the uniforms of incapacitated enemies, infiltrate guarded areas without drawing attention, or get close to targets and eliminate them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A VAST ARRAY OF OBJECTIVES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4431400/extras/c6db2f9ed34d46e5e8b1048b92b11b09.poster.avif?t=1780158940\" width=1170 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4431400/extras/c6db2f9ed34d46e5e8b1048b92b11b09.webm?t=1780158940\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4431400/extras/c6db2f9ed34d46e5e8b1048b92b11b09.mp4?t=1780158940\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your missions will involve more than just taking down dangerous enemies. You will also capture targets for interrogation, carry out acts of sabotage, steal secret documents, spread disinformation, rescue prisoners, andreestablish communications.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4431400/extras/d5738ac8c76fba827f67f889662493a0.poster.avif?t=1780158940\" width=1170 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4431400/extras/d5738ac8c76fba827f67f889662493a0.webm?t=1780158940\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4431400/extras/d5738ac8c76fba827f67f889662493a0.mp4?t=1780158940\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Non-linear missions and complete freedom in how you approach each objective.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ability to confront enemies head-on, eliminate them unnoticed, or even find entirely non-lethal solutions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A full arsenal of special operative techniques: disguises, silent takedowns, enemy distraction, lockpicking, knife throwing, placing booby traps, staging accidents, and hand-to-hand combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Authentic Second World War weapons and vehicles.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SOCIAL STEALTH</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4431400/extras/1c07458f327de0d9ce36992db3fbb4e7.poster.avif?t=1780158940\" width=1170 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4431400/extras/1c07458f327de0d9ce36992db3fbb4e7.webm?t=1780158940\" type=