.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4431400/extras/d5738ac8c76fba827f67f889662493a0.mp4?t=1780158940\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Non-linear missions and complete freedom in how you approach each objective.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ability to confront enemies head-on, eliminate them unnoticed, or even find entirely non-lethal solutions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A full arsenal of special operative techniques: disguises, silent takedowns, enemy distraction, lockpicking, knife throwing, placing booby traps, staging accidents, and hand-to-hand combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Authentic Second World War weapons and vehicles.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "A stealth action game set during World War II. You play as a SMERSH operative. Use disguises to get close to your target. Take out your foes with weapons or plan “unfortunate accidents.” No two playthroughs are alike.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4431400/0a2fc0fccc3d60a6f2514c0eb66a9e3d3ba178f4/header.jpg?t=1780158940", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4431400/ba851f5f5be0d847d8a76c3498eb946679674c6f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1780158940", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4431400/ba851f5f5be0d847d8a76c3498eb946679674c6f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1780158940", "website": "http://www.haggardgames.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> OS 64-bit Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6600K or AMD Ryzen R5 1600 processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>